#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&bovo; is a Gomoku (from Japanese <foreignphrase lang=\"ja\">五目並べ</"
"foreignphrase>lit. \"five points\") like game for two players, where the "
"opponents alternate in placing their respective pictogram on the game board. "
"The aim of this game is to connect five of your own pieces in an unbroken "
"row vertically, horizontally or diagonally."
msgstr ""
"&bovo; je kao i  Gomoku (iz japanske <foreignphrase lang=\"ja\">五目並べ</"
"foreignphrase> književnosti \"pet poena\") igra za dva igrača, gdje "
"protivnici naizmjenično postavljaju svoje žetone na ploču. Cilj ove igre je "
"složiti svojih pet žetona u neprekinuti niz uspravno, vodoravno ili "
"dijagonalno."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:78 index.docbook:87
#, no-c-format
msgid "Note:"
msgstr "Napomena:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:78
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Also known as: Connect Five, Five in a row, X and O, Noughts and Crosses"
msgstr "Također poznato kao: Poveži pet, Pet u nizu, X i O, Iks-Oks"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:81
#, no-c-format
msgid "How to play"
msgstr "Pravila igre"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:83
#, no-c-format
msgid "Objective:"
msgstr "Cilj:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:83
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Connect five of your own pieces in an unbroken row vertically, horizontally "
"or diagonally."
msgstr ""
"Poveži svojih pet žetona u neprekinuti niz uspravno, vodoravno ili "
"dijagonalno."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:84
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The first time &bovo; is started it is launched in demo mode where two AI "
"players battle each other. You can always start a new game using the "
"<guibutton>New</guibutton> button on the toolbar, the "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Game</guimenu><guimenuitem>New</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> menu entry on the menubar or using the default shortcut "
"<keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""
"Prvi put &bovo; se pokreće kao probna verzija gdje se takmiče dva igrača - "
"računari. Novu igru uvijek možeš početi koristeći opciju <guibutton> Nova "
"Igra </guibutton> iz trake sa alatima ,<menuchoice><guimenu>Igra</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Nova Igra</guimenuitem></menuchoice> ili koristiti "
"zadatu prečicu <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></"
"keycombo>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:87
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Because the first player always has an advantage over the second player, "
"&bovo; will alternate the players, switching them every new game."
msgstr ""
"Pošto prvi igrač uvijek ima prednost nad drugim igračem, &bovo; će "
"zamijeniti pozicije igrača u svakoj novoj igri."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you are the first player - start the game by placing your pictogram "
"anywhere on the playing field. If you are the second player wait until the "
"first player places the pictogram and then do the same yourself. You can "
"place your mark into any square on the field, unless it’s already occupied "
"by another game piece (regardless of whether it’s your pictogram or that of "
"your opponent’s)."
msgstr ""
"Ako si prvi igrač - igru počinješ tako što postvaljaš svoj žeton na bilo "
"koje polje na ploči. Ako si drugi igrač, sačekaj da prvi igrač postavi svoj "
"žeton, a zatim i ti možeš postaviti svoj žeton.  Svoj žeton možeš postaviti "
"na bilo koje polje na ploči, osim ako već nije zauzeto (bez obzira da li je "
"u pitanju tvoj ili protivnikov žeton)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:93
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You have to place your pieces in a way that prevents your opponent from "
"connecting five marks in an unbroken row vertically, horizontally or "
"diagonally. In the same time you have to connect five of your own pieces in "
"an unbroken row vertically, horizontally or diagonally. Whoever succeeds in "
"doing so first – wins the round."
msgstr ""
"Treba da postaviš svoj žeton tako da spriječiš svog protivnika da spoji pet "
"žetona u neprekidan niz uspravno, vodoravno ili dijagonalno. Istovremeno, i "
"ti trebaš da spojiš svojih pet žetona u neprekidan niz uspravno, "
"horizontalno ili vertikalno. Ko prvi uspije da spoji pet žetona, pobijeđuje "
"u toj rundi."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:98
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game Rules, Strategies and Tips"
msgstr "Pravila Igre, Strategija i Savjeti"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:101
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game Rules"
msgstr "Pravila Igre"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid "Players take turn to place their respective marks on the playing board."
msgstr "Igrači naizmjenično postavljaju svoje žetone na igraču ploču."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:104
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A player cannot move their already placed mark or put their mark upon an "
"already placed mark."
msgstr ""
"Igrač ne može pomaći žeton koji je već postavljen na polje u ploči niti "
"postaviti žeton preko postavljenog žetona."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:105
#, no-c-format
msgid "Players cannot forfeit their turns."
msgstr "Igrač ne može izgubiti pravo na potez."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:106
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Player who reaches five marks connected in a straight line (be it vertical, "
"horizontal or diagonal) wins the game."
msgstr ""
"Igrač koji prvi poveže 5 žetona u neprekidnu liniju (bilo verikalno, "
"horizontalno ili dijagonalno) pobjeđuje u igri."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:110
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game Tips"
msgstr "Savjeti za igru"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:112
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When &bovo; is started the first time, it needs resizing. Resize the game "
"window to desired size, and &bovo; will scale up the playing board."
msgstr ""
"Kad se &bovo; prvi put pokrene, potrbeno je podesiti veličinu ploče. "
"Podesite veličinu  prozora igre na željenu veličinu i &bovo; će podesiti "
"veličinu ploče za igranje."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:113
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The first time &bovo; is started it is launched in demo mode, where two AI "
"players battle each other."
msgstr ""
"Kada se &bovo; prvi put pokrene, otvara se probna verzija, gdje se dva "
"igrača - računara, takmiče jedan protiv drugog."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:114
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When &bovo; is exited prior to game over, the active game is auto saved. If "
"&bovo; detects an auto saved game at startup, it is restored. If not, &bovo; "
"launches a demo mode."
msgstr ""
"Ako se &bovo; napusti prije kraja igre, aktivna igra se automatski snima. "
"Ako &bovo; otkrije automatski snimljenu igru pri pokretanju, igra se "
"nastavlja. U suprotnom pokreće probnu verziju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:115
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can always start a new game with the <guibutton>New</guibutton> button "
"in the toolbar, the <menuchoice><guimenu>Game</guimenu><guimenuitem>New</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu entry in the menubar or with the default "
"shortcut <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""
"Novu igru uvijek možete početi pritiskom na opciju iz trake alata "
"<guibutton>Nova Igra</guibutton>, ulazom u traku menija "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Igra</guimenu><guimenuitem>Nova igra</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> ili zadatom prečicom na tastaturi <keycombo action=\"simul"
"\">&Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:116
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If a new game is started when a game is already active, it is counted as a "
"loss."
msgstr ""
"Ako se pokrene nova igra dok je jedna igra već aktivna,  cijeli sadržaj se "
"gubi."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:117
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Changing the difficulty can be done with the <guilabel>Difficulty</guilabel> "
"drop down box in the right end of the status bar, or from the "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Difficulty</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu in the menubar."
msgstr ""
"Promjenu nivoa težine možete izvršiti klikom na padajuću listu "
"<guilabel>Težina</guilabel> na desnom kraju statusne trake ili u "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Podešavanja</guimenu><guimenuitem>Težina</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> meniju, u izbornoj traci."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid "The effect of changing difficulty takes place immediately."
msgstr "Promjena nivoa složenosti igre odmah stupa na snagu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:119
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can switch the theme of &bovo; from the <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu> <guisubmenu>Theme</guisubmenu></menuchoice> menu in the menubar. "
"The theme is then switched immediately."
msgstr ""
"Promjenu izgleda za &bovo; možete izvršiti u meniju "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Podešavanja</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Izgled</guisubmenu></"
"menuchoice> u izbornoj traci."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:120
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Animation can be switched on or off as you like from the "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Animation</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu in the menubar."
msgstr ""
"Animacija se može uključiti/isključiti po želji u meniju "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Podešavanja</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Animacija</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> u izbornoj traci."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:121
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you just realized you made a very bad move, you have the possibility to "
"undo your last move from the toolbar, the menubar or with the default undo "
"keyboard shortcut <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Z</keycap></"
"keycombo>."
msgstr ""
"Ako ste shvatili da je vaš potez loš, imate mogućnost poništavanja zadnjeg "
"poteza u traci sa alatima, izbornoj traci ili zadatoj prečici za "
"poništavanje, na tastaturi, <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Z</"
"keycap></keycombo>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:121
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can keep on undoing moves until you reaches the beginning of the game."
msgstr "Možete poništavati poteze sve dok ne dođete do početka igre."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:122
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you don't know what move to make, you can get a hint from the computer "
"player with the <guibutton>Hint</guibutton> button. The game piece suggested "
"by the &bovo; AI then flashes for a brief period of time."
msgstr ""
"Ako ne znate koji potez da napravite, možete dobiti pomoć od računara "
"pritiskom na opciju <guibutton>Pomoć</guibutton>. Potez koji predlaže "
"računar će bljesnuti na trenutak."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:123
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When a game is over, the <guibutton>Replay</guibutton> action is enabled, "
"which starts a replay of the last game."
msgstr ""
"Nakon završetka igre, aktivira se opcija <guibutton>Igraj opet</guibutton>, "
"koja pokreće zadnju odigranu igru."

