"<shortcut> <keycap>H</keycap> </shortcut> <guimenu>Move</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Hint</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycap>H</keycap> </shortcut> <guimenu>Potez</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Pomoć</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:185
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Display</action> a hint for the next move. The game piece suggested "
"by the &bovo; AI then flashes for a brief period of time."
msgstr ""
"<action>Prikaži</action> pomoć za sljedeći potez.  Potez koji predlaže "
"računar će bljesnuti na trenutak."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:190
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guisubmenu>Theme</guisubmenu>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Podešavanja</guimenu><guisubmenu>Itgled</guisubmenu>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:191
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Choose one of the themes <guimenuitem>Scribble</guimenuitem>, "
"<guimenuitem>High Contrast</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Spacy</guimenuitem> "
"or <guimenuitem>Gomoku</guimenuitem> for the game."
msgstr ""
"Izaberite jedan od izgleda za igru <guimenuitem>Šareni</guimenuitem>, "
"<guimenuitem>Jaki kontrast</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Svemirski</"
"guimenuitem> ili <guimenuitem>Gomoku</guimenuitem>."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:196
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Animation </guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Podešavanja</guimenu><guimenuitem>Animacija</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:198
#, no-c-format
msgid "Switch the animation on or off."
msgstr "Upali ili ugasi animaciju."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:202
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guisubmenu>Difficulty</guisubmenu>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Podešavanja</guimenu><guisubmenu>Težina</guisubmenu>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:203
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Choose the game difficulty from various levels from "
"<guimenuitem>Ridiculously Easy</guimenuitem> up to <guimenuitem>Impossible</"
"guimenuitem>."
msgstr ""
"Izaberite jedan od niova složenosti iz opsega <guimenuitem>Veoma lagano</"
"guimenuitem> do <guimenuitem>Jako teško</guimenuitem>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:209
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Additionally &bovo; has the common &kde; <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> and "
"<guimenu>Help</guimenu> menu items, for more information read the sections "
"about the <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-settings\">Settings "
"Menu</ulink> and <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-help\">Help "
"Menu</ulink> of the &kde; Fundamentals."
msgstr ""
"Dodatno &bovo; ima &kde; <guimenu>Podešenja</guimenu> i <guimenu>Pomoć</"
"guimenu> opcije, za više informacija pročitajte osnovne  dijelove o upotrebi "
"<ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-settings\">Podešavanja</ulink> "
"i <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-help\">Pomoći</ulink>  &kde;."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:218
#, no-c-format
msgid "Frequently asked questions"
msgstr "Često postavljena pitanja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:223
#, no-c-format
msgid "I want to change the way this game looks. Can I?"
msgstr "Želim da promijenim izgled igre. Mogu li ?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:224
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yes. To change &kappname;'s visual theme you can use the "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guisubmenu>Theme</guisubmenu> </"
"menuchoice> option on the menubar."
msgstr ""
"Da. Da biste promijenili &kappname;ov izgled možete korisiti opciju "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Podešavanja</guimenu><guisubmenu>Izgled</guisubmenu> </"
"menuchoice>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:228
#, no-c-format
msgid "Can I use the keyboard to play this game?"
msgstr "Da li mogu igrati ovu igru pomoću tastature."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:229
#, no-c-format
msgid "No. The game of &kappname; cannot be played using keyboard."
msgstr "Ne. Igra  &kappname; ne može se igrati pomoću tastature."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:232
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"I have to quit the game now, but I am not finished yet. Can I save my "
"progress?"
msgstr ""
"Moram da napustim igru, ali još nije gotova. Da li mogu da snimim napredak?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:233
#, no-c-format
msgid "No. There is no <quote>Save</quote> feature in &kappname;."
msgstr "Ne. Ne postoji opcija <quote>Snimi</quote> u &kappname;u."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:236
#, no-c-format
msgid "Where are the highscores?"
msgstr "Gdje se nalaze najbolji rezultati?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:237
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kappname; does not have this feature."
msgstr "&kappname; ne podržava ovu opciju."

